{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Robot finds object, grasps, checks properties and then executes specific task, or scans area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />\"",
